7a-4691-a1b8-c8f6fc1f4569":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14491774451841__5c5d8f04-d57a-4691-a1b8-c8f6fc1f4569-1686667371258a4700-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"LANDING MATS"}},"template--14491774451841__5c5d8f04-d57a-4691-a1b8-c8f6fc1f4569-1686667371258a4700-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>Use these landing mats for extra protection and safety during jumps and flips. Made to absorb higher levels of shock, these mats will give you confidence when perfecting landings.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14491774451841__5c5d8f04-d57a-4691-a1b8-c8f6fc1f4569-1686667371258a4700-0","template--14491774451841__5c5d8f04-d57a-4691-a1b8-c8f6fc1f4569-1686667371258a4700-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/competition_landing_a03ac18a-cb24-46b2-b051-143e83d9a6dc.png","image_width":400,"title":"COMPETITION LANDING MATS","text":"<p>These mats are made of a top layer that provides stability for good footing and a bottom layer that absorbs impact from falls and throws. This makes these mats ideal for intermediate to expert level gymnastics.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner to Expert Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$25.25\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY NOW","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/competition-landing-mats"}},"template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Throw-Mats_aa4da9dc-9b56-4b99-86a7-c0770febcfe2.jpg","image_width":400,"title":"THROW MATS","text":"<p>These Throw Mats are made out of heavy-duty 18 oz, vinyl that can offer extra cushioning that is ideal for a more protective landing. These mats are great for absorbing jumps in activities such as gymnastics.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner to Expert Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$22.81\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY NOW","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/throw-mats"}},"template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Safetfy-Cushion_82f00d72-9178-4391-a0fc-b759b83bebf3_1.jpg","image_width":400,"title":"SAFETY CUSHIONS","text":"<p>Safety Cushions are made with a honeycomb foam and vinyl surface to offer durability and ultimate landing protection. These mats' thickness and shock absorbency are perfect for preventing injuries during gymnastics and cheerleading training.<\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner to Expert Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$27.97\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY NOW","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/safety-cushions"}}},"block_order":["template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-0","template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-1","template--14491774451841__a02b9154-40fc-44c2-a417-ada9378479d7-16866672593fde5310-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"4d5e6ead-6f66-45ae-b84d-6c46fb632efe":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_75_b6188d97-a93a-4811-877c-29f61e76300b.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"","title":"Velcro Fastener for Cheerleading Mats","text":"<p>Join multiple Roll-Out Cheerleading Mats with these fasteners to accomodate larger areas and more safety coverage.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Velcro Fasteners","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/velcro-fastener-for-cheerleading-mats","button_style":"primary","align_tex